BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kythnos-merichas-panigiri-of-agia-marina-merichas-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270716
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270718
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Marina\, Merichas
LOCATION:Merichas\, Kythnos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The port's summer feast at the chapel of Agia Marina in Merichas\, on the evening of 16 July\, with a glenti with island violin and laouto after vespers\; the Agia Marina at Lefkes celebrates the same night. It's the easiest Kythnos panigiri to reach — you can walk from the ferry — and the harbour tavernas stay open late for it.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythnos/#merichas-panigiri-of-agia-marina-merichas
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythnos/#merichas-panigiri-of-agia-marina-merichas
END:VEVENT
