BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kythnos-kanala-dormition-panigiri-of-panagia-kanala-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Dormition panigiri of Panagia Kanala
LOCATION:Kanala\, Kythnos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The island's patroness\, whose icon was found floating in the channel between Kythnos and Serifos\, draws pilgrims from all over the Aegean: vespers on 14 August at the pine-shaded shrine above Kanala beach\, an all-night glenti with violin and laouto\, and on the 15th a liturgy and a re-enactment of the icon's finding with a procession down to the little harbour. Rooms in Kanala sell out weeks ahead\; most people stay in Dryopida or Chora and drive over.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythnos/#kanala-dormition-panigiri-of-panagia-kanala
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythnos/#kanala-dormition-panigiri-of-panagia-kanala
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kythnos-kanala-dormition-panigiri-of-panagia-kanala-2028@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20280814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20280816
SUMMARY:Dormition panigiri of Panagia Kanala
LOCATION:Kanala\, Kythnos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The island's patroness\, whose icon was found floating in the channel between Kythnos and Serifos\, draws pilgrims from all over the Aegean: vespers on 14 August at the pine-shaded shrine above Kanala beach\, an all-night glenti with violin and laouto\, and on the 15th a liturgy and a re-enactment of the icon's finding with a procession down to the little harbour. Rooms in Kanala sell out weeks ahead\; most people stay in Dryopida or Chora and drive over.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythnos/#kanala-dormition-panigiri-of-panagia-kanala
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythnos/#kanala-dormition-panigiri-of-panagia-kanala
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kythnos-flabouria-nine-day-feast-of-panagia-flabouriani-flabouria-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270822
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270824
SUMMARY:Nine-day feast of Panagia Flabouriani\, Flabouria
LOCATION:Flabouria\, Kythnos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Named by the municipality among the island's most important feasts: the nine-day of the Dormition at Panagia Flabouriani\, the chapel by the west-coast beach of Flabouria\, on the evening of 22 August and the morning of the 23rd\, with the usual violin-laouto glenti. Panagia Eleousa at Kastro celebrates the same date. The last stretch to Flabouria is a rough track from Chora — a 4x4 or a walk.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythnos/#flabouria-nine-day-feast-of-panagia-flabouriani-flabouria
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythnos/#flabouria-nine-day-feast-of-panagia-flabouriani-flabouria
END:VEVENT
