BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kythnos-kanala-nativity-of-the-virgin-panigiri-panagia-kanala-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270907
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270909
SUMMARY:Nativity of the Virgin panigiri\, Panagia Kanala
LOCATION:Kanala\, Kythnos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Kanala's second big feast\, for the Nativity of the Virgin\, with vespers on 7 September and liturgy on the 8th at the shrine\, plus the Kalolivadiani chapel at Kalo Livadi celebrating the same day. Quieter than 15 August and with September prices\, it's the better pick if you want the Kanala atmosphere without the crush — the beach below is still warm enough to swim.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythnos/#kanala-nativity-of-the-virgin-panigiri-panagia-kanala
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythnos/#kanala-nativity-of-the-virgin-panigiri-panagia-kanala
END:VEVENT
